{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Device-TYPE templates for the Add-Devices bulk hub. Each template maps a device type to a REAL connector kind in catalog.json (field `kind`); parser / source_kind / sama are cross-checked against that catalog entry at load (engine/onboard/bulk.js resolveTemplates) so they never drift. `default_port` / `proto` are the SIEM syslog listener the device points at (udp/tcp 5514, tls 6514); `snmp` is the UDP port used for range auto-discovery classification. `planned_parser` is the dedicated parser listed as planned in the catalogue (generic syslog/CEF parser used today).",
